                    {
                        "sense_id": "74501070-97b7-302c-bf7b-e46a4eb4fed8",
                        "entry_id": "34a8fea3-87ab-3b3b-86c4-bb953754d27f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Leader."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7e5f0924-a4a2-4f91-870a-e856a2e2a9ea",
                                "sense_id": "74501070-97b7-302c-bf7b-e46a4eb4fed8",
                                "text": "The Egyptians, when they introduce God under the Symbolic Image of one that governes a Ship, thereby signifie his Domination and Empire as Gubernator of the Universe. For as a Gubernator of a Ship […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "81d9f490-0a11-4ae4-b5b2-b61aa884f08a",
                                "sense_id": "74501070-97b7-302c-bf7b-e46a4eb4fed8",
                                "text": "Marcus Minutius Mude, a soldier of the sixth legion victorious, in performance of a vow, dedicated the altar to the African, Italian, Gallican (Goddesses, the) Mothers, to the Gubernator of the Sixth Legion. The writer confessed there was some inconsistency in the dedications to the Matres, &c., and to the Gubernator; […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "326fcf18-cef4-3c7c-aa5e-e8fa61e87115",
                        "entry_id": "34a8fea3-87ab-3b3b-86c4-bb953754d27f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Governor."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "humorous"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8785ff88-353c-4f57-9b74-c59ebc09b478",
                                "sense_id": "326fcf18-cef4-3c7c-aa5e-e8fa61e87115",
                                "text": "Stanford poll: Terminator in lead to become gubernator"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5600268d-9ec1-4026-bc75-2e766ec5cf78",
                                "sense_id": "326fcf18-cef4-3c7c-aa5e-e8fa61e87115",
                                "text": "So, why don't we send the gubernator back to Austria,[…]and sponsor a collective effort to repeal the Loud Pipes Law and that ludicrous Healthcare Abomination."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "974130e4-6564-4f39-be74-a1d73fd34f4d",
                                "sense_id": "326fcf18-cef4-3c7c-aa5e-e8fa61e87115",
                                "text": "So what test did Gubernator Perry pass to became such a brain dead dipshit?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1298007f-7bf6-4604-8474-7d39ee4ef83c",
                                "sense_id": "326fcf18-cef4-3c7c-aa5e-e8fa61e87115",
                                "text": "And that is encouraging, because it’s nice to know that if you use Trump tactics in a Virginia gubernatorial election, you do not get to be gubernator."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
